Subject: [PATCH 17/26] ling: gate-5 records for tf_ling_chunks_split_r16 and
 tf_ling_merge_part (nvcc 13.0 from the host's /usr/local/cuda-13.0, 13.3 from
 the build image, five-SM fatbins as the build compiles glm_glue; 13.2
 pending)

---
 zig/src/core/contract/ling_cuda_records.zig        | 2 ++
 zig/src/core/contract/measurements/pending_133.zig | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/zig/src/core/contract/ling_cuda_records.zig b/zig/src/core/contract/ling_cuda_records.zig
index e4b39b0cf..22e004c3b 100644
